Or, if you have more gold than the most expensive item 
is worth at selling, stash the items in a corner, and 
build a 'gold hole' like following: 

        |CCC
        @d$C
        |CCC

where 'C' means "place cursed item".  Once you get 
your pet in position, this works quite well.  

> > Some players have the time, some don't.
